name: a recorded session played to its end: /play 8 on the Broadcast channel (Zanor, 2026-10-21 11:16), two sector sessions, then the replay's own hand-off home
# Recording 8 (session_2026-10-21_111654, Net-7, the capture's first avatar; 9 is the same capture's second):
# 2 sector sessions, 1964 messages: 1 sector 1910 (503 messages over 99 s), then by the recording's own
# SERVER_HANDOFF 2 sector 1070 (1461 over 244 s); its end antreplay answers with 'End of recording 8; back to
# Jupiter.' and a SERVER_HANDOFF home, whose connection answers START_ACK. No /stop: the playback runs to its
# completion (the user, 2026-11-14). About 380 s on retail and on ours (E2, 2026-11-15: both PASS, the packets
# the same; ours hits the generated stand-in Unknown_496E90).
timeout: 700
messages: on
include _login
key 0x08
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x8'
alive 1
text '/play 8'
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'command "/play 8"' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 20
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 8, sector session 1 of 2' within 60
move 640,600
wait-event msg 'Render: Frame Rate' within 90
shot play8_s1
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 8, sector session 2 of 2' within 400
move 640,600
wait-event msg 'Render: Frame Rate' within 90
shot play8_s2
wait-event antprox 'Playback of 8: end of the recording; back to' within 400
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF.*back to' within 10
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: received START_ACK' within 120
wait-quiet proxy 2 within 60
alive 8
shot play8_home
